# Sugar Price Agreement Dates

This scope defines the key date ranges for the guaranteed prices of cane sugar as established by the agreement.

```catala
declaration scope SugarPriceAgreement:
  input delivery_start content date
  input delivery_end content date
  output special_price_cutoff content date
  output is_delivery_period_valid content boolean
```

## Delivery Period Validity

The guaranteed prices apply for the period starting on 1 July 1994 and ending on 30 June 1995.

```catala
scope SugarPriceAgreement:
  date round down
  definition is_delivery_period_valid equals
    (delivery_start = |1994-07-01|) and
    (delivery_end = |1995-06-30|)
```

## Special Price Cutoff

The special prices are understood to apply until 31 January 1995.

```catala
scope SugarPriceAgreement:
  definition special_price_cutoff equals |1995-01-31|
```